<title>USA: Garden Botanika CFO to retire this year.</title>
<headline>Garden Botanika CFO to retire this year.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Garden Botanika Inc Wednesday said Chief Financial Officer Myron Kirkpatrick plans to retire during 1997.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said it will begin a search for a successor.</p>
</text>
